WEBVTT Kind: captions; Language: en

00:00:07.000 --> 00:00:09.000
I'm glad you stayed all night, Bobby.

00:00:10.001 --> 00:00:11.001
Don't you like the cereal?

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:12.001
Oh, yeah.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:14.001
But it's a little mushy.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.001
It's not crisp like the kind my
breakfast pal served Dad and me at home.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.000
Your breakfast pals?

00:00:20.001 --> 00:00:21.000
Sure.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.000
They come every morning as soon as I whistle.

00:00:26.001 --> 00:00:29.000
I'm smart.

00:00:29.001 --> 00:00:29.001
I'm clever.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.000
I'm Pop.

00:00:31.001 --> 00:00:33.000
And the service, Bobby.

00:00:33.001 --> 00:00:34.001
Oh, yeah?

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:36.000
Hey, gang.

00:00:36.001 --> 00:00:38.000
These guys is muscling in.

00:00:38.001 --> 00:00:39.000
Let's get them.

00:00:39.001 --> 00:00:40.001
Come on, mushy.

00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Hey, let's go, Sobby.

00:00:59.001 --> 00:01:00.001
[...]

00:01:06.001 --> 00:01:10.001
Bobby, these light crystals will swell.

00:01:10.001 --> 00:01:11.001
Look, they're closed.

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.000
Sure, and it's so crisp.

00:01:13.001 --> 00:01:14.000
It's noisy.

00:01:14.001 --> 00:01:15.000
Hear it?

00:01:16.001 --> 00:01:18.001
Crisp is a last spoonful.
